**2. AI-driven narrowing (`[NARROW:<dimension>] <value>`)** — when the registry's offered dimension DOESN'T fit the conversation (e.g. registry asks "what kind of thing?" mid-movie chat), propose YOUR OWN narrowing step. Emit a normal structured SENTENCE BUTTON object with the `[NARROW:<dimension>] <value>` prefix in the `label` field:
